## Yamaha DX7 factory patch data — provenance note

`engine/faust/dx7-presets.json` holds 113 presets decoded
(`engine/faust/sysex2params.js`) from the eight Yamaha DX7 factory ROM
cartridges (ROM1A "Master" … ROM4B, 1983), fetched from the
yamahablackboxes.com sysex mirrors. These banks have been freely redistributed
by Yamaha-adjacent archives, synth museums, and every DX7 editor project for
four decades (Dexed ships them; bwhitman/learnfm's 31k-patch corpus contains
them); Yamaha has never asserted rights over the patch DATA — PD-adjacent by
long convention, noted here rather than claimed as a formal grant. The raw
.syx cartridge files are not committed; only decoded parameter JSON is.

